{"schema_version":1,"receipt_id":"source-repair-math-0002:nardebam_math_1405_0069","batch_id":"source-repair-math-0002","question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0069","source_sha256":"8506cded62aa3aaa4a4b33443e226759eae7241b548d2cc88662d9dc03fc4f29","runtime_record_sha256":"8506cded62aa3aaa4a4b33443e226759eae7241b548d2cc88662d9dc03fc4f29","reviewer_id":"codex-sol-xhigh-source-repair-0002:nardebam_math_1405_0069","reviewed_on":"2026-08-11","verdict":"repaired_matches_source","conflict_receipt_id":"source-fidelity-math-0002:nardebam_math_1405_0069","conflict_receipt_sha256":"04ae9ed16aaa251fbefabec16b8f02c7d32632a93f2a95d9ed8ce0f592c2410c","repaired_fields":["solution"],"verified_fields":["question_number","source_option_index","stem","options","solution"],"repair_summary":"Recovered the continuation of the source solution from the following printed solution page, including both source methods and the final hypotenuse 20.","content_patch":{"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"روش اول: اضلاع مثلث قائم‌الزاویه را $a$، $b$ و $c$ می‌نامیم که در آن $c$ وتر است. چون اضلاع یک دنبالهٔ حسابی می‌سازند، $b=a+d$ و $c=a+2d$ است.\n$c^2=a^2+b^2 \\Rightarrow (a+2d)^2=a^2+(a+d)^2$\n$\\Rightarrow a^2-2ad-3d^2=0 \\Rightarrow (a+d)(a-3d)=0$\nاز مثبت‌بودن طول اضلاع، $a=-d$ مردود و $a=3d$ پذیرفتنی است. پس اضلاع $3d$، $4d$ و $5d$ هستند.\n$S=\\frac{ab}{2}=\\frac{3d\\times4d}{2}=6d^2=96 \\Rightarrow d^2=16 \\Rightarrow d=4$\n$c=a+2d=3d+2d=5d=20$\nروش دوم: اضلاع هر مثلث قائم‌الزاویه‌ای که دنبالهٔ حسابی بسازند، متناسب با $3k$، $4k$ و $5k$ هستند. بنابراین $\\frac{3k\\times4k}{2}=96$، پس $k=4$ و وتر $5k=20$ است."}]},"effective_record_sha256":"835aca5d41ab24797a21c794e5c56e6a5d8751c4dbb0cca8e0f6509858612f39","answer_mapping":null,"question_source":{"logical_pdf":"math/2.pdf","pdf_sha256":"f0b9021a8315b9b3f5e1cd49543930158e5f919c857756e7ccf2497f1d96377a","pdf_ordinal":6,"recorded_question_page":6,"question_number":69,"rendered_page_sha256":"031a576c1d9801f768c9bd97f41eed2b349523e2c7169a2d036d143eca4ba7d1"},